#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_Gravity)
#. +> trunk stable
#: settings.ui:31
msgid "Gravity"
msgstr "Swoorkraft"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_Gravity)
#. +> trunk stable
#: settings.ui:34
msgid ""
"<b>Gravity:</b>"
"<p>Checking this makes the game even harder: If a tile is removed, all tiles lying above it will fall down one step.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b> Swoorkraft</b>"
"<p> Dit maakt dat Speel sworer. Wenn en Steen wegdaan wöör, fallt all anner Steen de över em wörrn, een Platz daal. </p>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_Solvable)
#. +> trunk stable
#: settings.ui:41
msgid "Allow unsolvable games"
msgstr "Nich löösbore Spelen verlöven"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_Solvable)
#. +> trunk stable
#: settings.ui:44
msgid ""
"<b>Allow unsolvable games:.</b>"
"<p>If checked, you run the risk of being presented with games that are impossible to solve.</p>"
"<p>Note: Even when not checked, you will fail to complete a game if you remove the tiles in the wrong order!</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Nich löösbor Spelen tolaten:.</b>"
"<p>Wenn dit anmaakt is, kann dat wesen, dat Du Spelen kriggst, de nich löösbor sünd.</p>"
"<p>Henwies: Ok wenn dit utmaakt is, kann dat liekers wesen, dat sik en Speel nich lösen lett, wenn de Steen in de falsche Reeg wegdaan warrt!</p>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_ChineseStyle)
#. +> trunk stable
#: settings.ui:51
msgid "Use Chinese style: any flower match any flower, any season match any season"
msgstr "Chineesch Stil bruken: Elk Bloom paßt to elk Bloom, elk Johrstied to elk Johrstied"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_ChineseStyle)
#. +> trunk stable
#: settings.ui:54
msgid ""
"<b>Use Chinese style: any flower match any flower, any season match any season</b>"
"<p>Use the traditional rules for matching the tiles. Previous version of the game used to allow only exact tiles matches, which is inconsistent with Mah-jongg rules. It is recommended to keep this option checked.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Chineesch Stil bruken: Elk Bloom paßt to elk Bloom, elk Johrstied to elk Johrstied</b>"
"<p>Bruukt traditschonell Regeln för passen Steen. De verleden Speelverschoon hett bloots nau passen Steen tolaten, dat is aver nich na de Regeln vun Mah-jongg wesen. Dat Aktiveren vun disse Instellen is anraadt.</p>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_TilesCanSlide)
#. +> trunk stable
#: settings.ui:61
msgid "Tiles can slide, but you can connect only in 2 lines instead of 3"
msgstr "Steen laat sik verschuven, man Du kannst bloots twee ansteed vun dree Lienen verbinnen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_TilesCanSlide)
#. +> trunk stable
#: settings.ui:64
msgid ""
"<b>Tiles can slide, but you can connect only in 2 lines instead of 3</b>"
"<p>This option changes the rules to the point where it almost becomes a completely different game. When it is active, you can only remove the tiles if they can be connected by a line consiting of only two segments instead of the customary three. However, you are allowed to slide the tiles on the board, if the row or column where they are placed has some empty space.  To make a sliding move, you have to click on the tile containing the column or row that can slide, and then on the matching tile. If there are two possible sliding moves, you will have to click on one of the two connecting lines to chose your preferred move.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Steen laat sik verschuven, man Du kannst bloots twee ansteed vun dree Lienen verbinnen</b>"
"<p>Disse Instellen ännert de Speelregeln so deegt, dat dor fast en kumplett anner Speel bi rutkummt. Wenn dit anmaakt is, laat sik bloots Steen wegdoon, de sik mit en Lien ut twee Segmenten ansteed vun dree verbinnen laat. Du kannst aver de Steen verschuven, wenn dor free Ruum för is. För't Verschuven muttst Du toeerst en Steen anklicken, de binnen en verschuuvbor Striep oder Reeg liggt, un denn den passen Steen. Wenn dat twee Mööglichkeiten för't Verschuven gifft, muttst Du Dien vörtrocken Tog dör Anklicken op een vun de twee Verbinnenlienen kören.</p>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, difficulty_groupBox)
#. +> trunk stable
#: settings.ui:71
msgid "Board Difficulty"
msgstr "Speelstärk"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QGroupBox, difficulty_groupBox)
#. +> trunk stable
#: settings.ui:74
msgid ""
"<b>Board Difficulty</b>"
"<p>The slider controls the difficulty of the board from Easy to Hard.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Speelstärk</b>"
"<p>Mit den Schuver lett sik de Speelstärk vun eenfach bet swoor instellen.</p>"

